Somebody wants that list destroyed,
and hired the intruder to do it?

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.190
Most likely.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:08.600
He must have planted a bomb.
Have the security system search for it!

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.030
That's impossible.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:14.770
I told you, Pandora is controlled
by a completely independent computer.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:17.800
Honestly! Can't you make anything useful?

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:19.570
Where are you going?

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:21.240
To the vault, obviously!

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:26.410
You can't! The security system covers the
bridge floor in a 10,000-volt neo-beam shield!

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:27.670
What?!

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:53.710
Mughi, Nanmo, meet me at the vault.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:01.610
Hey Mughi, you shouldn't waste food
or divine punishment will come your way.

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:10.890
That might have been cute
if he were half his size.

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.510
You're finally here.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.580
I need to you two to find a bomb.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:39.150
Don't cross this bridge until I destroy
the computer that's controlling it.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.480
The floor is booby-trapped.

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:46.220
Here I go, Professor!

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:49.430
Listen closely, Yuri.

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:53.570
If you destroy the computer,
the entire system will shut down!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.540
Understood.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:54.560
Why don't you just tell me
what you came here for?

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:58.450
And what would you do with the information?

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:04.360
Either the bomb will do us in or
we'll go insane, whichever comes first.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:09.410
Although, if you can find a way to
get me out of here, I might just tell you.

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:11.050
I don't want to die!

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:13.250
My partner will figure something out.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.910
She's not the type to give up on
a five-thousand-credit bet.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.790
I can't let Kei die.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.520
I'll lose out on five thousand credits!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.390
Oh, no! Once the barrier is up, it's all over!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.570
Hurry!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:04.590
Nanmo, hurry!

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:32.880
Good work.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:38.890
Kei!

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:41.570
I know what his objective was.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:44.260
He was going to erase
the files on a particular man.

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:46.060
That means I win!

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:48.470
You owe me five thousand credits.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.420
Thank you for waiting.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:58.910
Allow me to introduce your
presidential candidate, Mr. Guilder.

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:00.580
Hello!

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:02.690
Thank you, everyone!

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:06.960
I am truly grateful that so many
of my supporters have gathered to...

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:13.400
Everyone, please stay calm!
Everything is all right!

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.700
Hey, the lights! Turn on the lights!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.440
Thank you, thank you.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:22.040
So as I was saying, I, Guilder,

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:26.780
have worked hard and will continue
to work hard every day to improve your lives.

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.980
S-Sir!

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:32.820
This is Andole, a con artist and wanted criminal.

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:37.360
20 years ago, he conned a woman into marriage,
murdered her, and has been on the run ever since.

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:44.630
He used plastic surgery to alter his face, but his
voice and fingerprints match those of Mr. Guilder.

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:47.430
Furthermore, the statute of limitations
on his crime has yet to pass.

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:52.270
So when are you going to give me
those five thousand credits?

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:55.680
Huh? What are you talking about?
I don't remember ever placing a bet.

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:58.200
After all, I thought you didn't like to gamble.

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:01.170
Hey!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.580
Hey, hand over my-

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:06.250
Hey, Kei!

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:07.620
Come back here!

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:08.890
Shoot, run!

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:10.620
Why do I have to run, too?

00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:12.490
That's what partners are for!

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:49.860
The mystery began after I fell asleep that time
Ano toki nemuri no ato ni okotta mistuerii

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:56.400
I was guided by a voice from the future
Mirai kara kuru koe ni michibikareta no yo

00:22:56.400 --> 00:23:02.840
I passed through a distant, silvery time tunnel
Giniro haruka na taimu tonneru nukete

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:09.510
And met a wanderer with unclouded eyes
Deatta sunda me no samayoibito

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:11.920
Space Fantasy

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:16.160
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:18.390
Space Fantasy

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:22.300
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:28.770
Even if you were from another planet,
Tatoeba anata ga betsu no hoshi no hito demo

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:35.200
It wouldn't matter to me, if I'd fallen in love
Watashi wa kamawanai aishita nara

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:39.040
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:39.110 --> 00:23:41.750
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:48.120
Love is zero G...
Koi wa mujuuryoku...

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:01.100
I can't...

00:24:01.100 --> 00:24:02.840
I can't say that.

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:04.640
What's wrong with you?

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:07.140
It's dirty! I don't want to say it.

00:24:07.140 --> 00:24:09.010
How is it dirty?

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:10.880
Then you're okay with it?

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:12.610
You overthink things, Yuri.

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:14.720
Th-Then you say it, Kei.

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:16.410
Fine, I'll say it.

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:20.650
Next episode is, "Dig Here, Meow Meow.
Happiness Comes at the End!"

00:24:20.650 --> 00:24:21.990
Ahh! At the end?!

00:24:21.990 --> 00:24:23.060
Next Episode
Dig Here, Meow Meow
Happiness Comes at the End
Ahh! At the end?!

00:24:23.060 --> 00:24:25.790
Next Episode
Dig Here, Meow Meow
Happiness Comes at the End
Listen everyone, don't think
about it too hard, okay?

